        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Subflow: recomputes a Line Item's Invoiced and Collected amounts as the sum of its invoice allocations. ExcludeAllocationId supports the before-delete trigger (the doomed row must not count). Bulk-safe: Flow auto-bulkifies the query and update across interviews.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Recalc Line Amounts {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Recalc Line Amounts</label>
